# VHS tape for the v0.2 demo gif.
# Run: vhs docs/v0.2-demo.tape   →   docs/v0.2-demo.gif

Output docs/v0.2-demo.gif

Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "bash docs/v0.2-demo.sh"
Enter
Show

Sleep 26s
